  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nStep 14.12.2 of [\"apply the history step\"](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#apply-the-history-step) uses \"displayedEntry\" as the last argument of [\"update document for history step application\"](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#update-document-for-history-step-application).\r\n\r\nWhile it is defined in step 12.1, displayedEntry is out of scope by step 14.12.2",
